{"symbol":"QNT.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:56:03Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Walerego Slawka 3A","city":"Kraków","zip":"30-633","country":"Poland","phone":"48 12 646 9800","fax":"48 12 646 9802","website":"https://quantum-software.com","industry":"Software - Application","industryKey":"software-application","industryDisp":"Software - Application","sector":"Technology","sectorKey":"technology","sectorDisp":"Technology","longBusinessSummary":"Quantum software S.A. provides IT systems for enterprises in the domain of logistics and delivery chain management in Poland and internationally. It offers Qguar Manufacturing Execution System, a manufacturing execution system that enables the user to model production processes and to monitor the course of their realization; Qguar Advanced Planning & Scheduling, a system designed for production planning and scheduling; Qguar Warehouse Management System (WMS) Pro, a system designed to support warehousing processes in company-owned warehouses or warehouses that rent storage space; and Qguar WMS Easyway and Qguar WMS e-Commerce solutions. The company also provides Qguar Material Flow Control, a system that takes care of communication between a WMS and automated warehousing equipment; Qguar Link4Ship, a software developed to provide on-line communication between the WMS and IT systems of courier services; Qguar Transport Management System, a software for transport management; Qguar TMS Mobile, a TMS designed for mobile devices; and Qguar DS System for planning of time windows and management of traffic in warehouse loading docks. It offers Qguar Yard Management System, a software that allows vehicle and pedestrian traffic to be controlled within plant premises; Qguar 4WEB system, a tool designed to carry out a specific set of activities by means of a web browser; Qguar DAS System for data archiving and reduction of production servers load; Qguar IFC, a ready-to-use tool for data exchange between Qguar and external systems; Qguar RPS system for the circulation of pallets and returnable packing units; Qguar SBS System; internet of things products and SCADA system; industrial sensors; and processes visualisation solutions. The company also provides implementation, training, support, wireless and cable network, and IT related services. The company was founded in 1993 and is based in Kraków, Poland. Quantum software S.A. is a subsidiary of Quantum Assets Sp. z o.o.","fullTimeEmployees":191,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Tomasz  Hatala","title":"President of Management Board & CEO","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Marek  Jedra","title":"Vice President of Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Boguslaw  Ozog","title":"Vice President of Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Tomasz  Mnich","title":"Member of Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Robert  Dykacz","title":"Member of Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Monika  Kus","title":"Chief Accountant","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":37.2,"open":36,"dayLow":36,"dayHigh":36,"regularMarketPreviousClose":37.2,"regularMarketOpen":36,"regularMarketDayLow":36,"regularMarketDayHigh":36,"dividendRate":1.8,"dividendYield":4.84,"exDividendDate":1781740800,"payoutRatio":0.5279,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":5.96,"beta":0.19,"trailingPE":10.5572,"volume":250,"regularMarketVolume":250,"averageVolume":685,"averageVolume10days":38,"averageDailyVolume10Day":38,"bid":36,"ask":40,"marketCap":49135320,"nonDilutedMarketCap":50773164,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":24.4,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":46.8,"allTimeHigh":65,"allTimeLow":2.8,"fulldayPrice":36,"fulldayChange":-1.2,"fulldayChangePercent":-3.22581,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.829092,"fiftyDayAverage":40.864,"twoHundredDayAverage":34.